Subject: [PATCH 2/2] Share Partie 1 of claude-on-scotch as a part, and as its
 own deck
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Partie 1 (« Mon modèle mental des LLM », ~20 min) moves verbatim to
parts/mental-model-llm.html. claude-on-scotch.html pulls it back in with
<section data-include="../parts/mental-model-llm.html">, resolved at
runtime by the new resources/include.js (fetch + <template>, each
placeholder replaced in place by the part's top-level sections, Reveal
initialized once window.slideIncludes resolves; a part that fails to load
becomes one visible error slide). No build step: the site stays static.

slides/mental-model-of-llms.html is the same part as a standalone talk:
a title slide, the part, a closing slide linking to the long version.

The e2e golden of claude-on-scotch is unchanged: the deck renders the
exact same slides. A golden is added for the new deck. index.html is
generated from the writings repo and is not touched here; the new deck
needs an entry there.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01QQHyq5ywP1n6qJNJS1Ajrz
