+## Shared parts
+A set of slides used by several decks lives once in `parts/` and is pulled
+in at runtime by `resources/include.js`:
+
+```html
+<section data-include="../parts/mental-model-llm.html"></section>
+```
+
+The deck initializes Reveal after `window.slideIncludes` resolves (see any
+deck that uses it). `parts/mental-model-llm.html` is Partie 1 of
+`claude-on-scotch.html` and the whole of `mental-model-of-llms.html`. Like
+the recordings and transcripts this needs HTTP (`python3 -m http.server`),
+`file://` blocks `fetch()`.
+
+## Tests
+`bun install && bun test tests/e2e` opens every deck in headless Chromium
+and compares its structure to `tests/e2e/golden/`: see
+[tests/e2e/README.md](tests/e2e/README.md).
